    <string name="about_mascot">pktito\'s mascot, a budgie beside a speech bubble and a transcript</string>
    <string name="about_tagline"><![CDATA[A compact Parakeet implementation <i>(pronounced “pick-a-tito”)</i><br>Speech to text on this device.]]></string>
