    <string name="about_models"><![CDATA[NVIDIA\'s <a href="https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2">parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2</a> and <a href="https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3">-v3</a>, under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC&nbsp;BY&nbsp;4.0</a>, modified by pktito (partly quantized to int8). Provided as is, without warranties. pktito is not affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA.]]></string>
